  "question": {
    "text": "A point object is placed as shown. The two pieces are of the same lens of focal length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. Find the distance (in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cm</mi></math>) between the two images formed by two pieces of the lens.<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0027_91ac877e45f5.jpeg\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The distance of image formed by each piece can be calculated by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>m</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>30</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0027_8381b24a84db.jpeg\" /></p>"
  }
